Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The text-only items of docs/CONNECTOR_UPDATE_D738.md, word for word as
proposed there and approved under §110.5: no word-for-word relay (1.3,
2.8), the approve word and the first „კი" (1.2, shared with the app's
approve tool), no plan when nothing is sent (1.7), number sharing points to
the app (1.8), Lists (1.9), a hello gets a hello (1.10), Ally → Netai
(1.11; the real old-Ally-account wording kept), „რისთვის" (2.1), no false
"sent" and the evening-card hold (2.2/2.3), refunds in get_netai_info (2.4,
description only), two a day (2.6), boundary notes (2.10), Lookups and the
registered surname (2.12).

Not in this commit: the items marked "needs code" (1.1, 1.4, 1.5, 1.6, 2.7)
and the two netai_info rows of 2.4, which are live DB content.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
